{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"0dd80d7c176752654b703eb33d976615f793292286e148fef2385c2d7d430c3a","ja":"たどり着いたラスト","zh":"抵达的结局","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"e1599a6990a99842fdc78af5f320d2fb386da80fbeaedbbf989b2fbf607f4639","ja":"数日後……。","zh":"几天后……。","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"2fe4478727ebe25af84aeb4c1c8abb560aa3da50f28d78bf8bf2f4778d7c3302","ja":"（リレー小説の最終締め切りまで、あと2日……\nそろそろ書き始めないと……でも……）","zh":"（接力小说的最终截稿日期，还剩2天……\n差不多该动笔写了……可是……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"9111841724b551a81a522671d23e6ef06b0bc2f59787223d4791a95327ba2925","ja":"（私が演じている小説家みたいに、\n私にも才能があれば、よかったのだけれど……）","zh":"（要是能像我扮演的小说家那样，\n我也拥有才能就好了……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"f583e011476b45bb384949a3760caa55edcd3986df1d867eff0272a38449b5bf","ja":"お疲れさまで～す♪　あ、千早ちゃん！\nリレー小説のお仕事中？","zh":"辛苦啦～♪ 啊，千早！\n正在忙接力小说的工作吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"9067b92884ab95fd9ca114a12be7a3cbc3e6039efdcc2d7f2dc5a3c9c587ed65","ja":"ラストって、難しそうですよね……。\nなにかありさにお手伝いできることありませんか？","zh":"收尾感觉会很难呢……\n有什么是亚利沙能帮忙的吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"86db6bd83eb56d40b6c672b44b6e13ccd6082ff44c172a09decbd52a62fcf65c","ja":"ありがとう。けど、ふたりはちゃんと\n自分のパートを書きあげたのだから。","zh":"谢谢你。不过，你们两个都已经\n好好写完了各自负责的部分。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"6638916a9d0ff3311f901fd48a5e38a15ef29954139faca84759ec1375f21e66","ja":"ここからは、私が自分で頑張らないと。\nみんなの努力を無駄にしないためにも。","zh":"接下来，我必须靠自己努力了。\n也是为了不让大家的努力白费。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"9094c4ad25c5c7dcbddf77736b9bbf4481efa86dd3566b4df506a57b52de49dc","ja":"そう？　でも……なんだか気になるな～。\n千早ちゃん、小説書くの、ちゃんと楽しんでる？","zh":"是吗？可是……总觉得有点在意呢～。\n千早，你写小说写得开心吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"cf60e61f489b37dd95f7f9751d8ac6a8e25672f18cae07033104270129e2354e","ja":"えっ……？","zh":"咦……？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"5059a837431bde2259af3b655cd55ebb23a60e0b0166eac0aa7c2c3efe8b4829","ja":"あのね、私は小説書くとき、とってもワクワク\nしたんだ。何を書こうかなってドキドキもして！","zh":"跟你说哦，我写小说的时候，心情超级兴奋\n的。还在想要写些什么的时候，心也怦怦直跳！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"4d8bd6025203bf1bb5ef849be36d527bec736d42c0fc15bc06d274321ab2c9ec","ja":"だからね、千早ちゃんもすっごく楽しい気持ちで\n小説を書くことができたら、素敵だろうな～って♪","zh":"所以呢，要是千早也能带着非常开心的心情\n去写小说的话，那就太棒啦～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"d3f9382255df4820b2ba55be56188256c368bc32b524e7b9c88632f426c22dd2","ja":"そうですね！　ありさも自分の欲ぼ……\nいえ、願いを込めて楽しく書かせてもらいましたから！","zh":"就是说呀！亚利沙也倾注了自己的欲……\n不对，倾注了自己的心愿，写得非常开心呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"2fa5321a10a01b5b586cebf61fc9bf7da6e7281597655bf21515f4319b8566bf","ja":"その結果、物語に関係ない『同じピアノ教室に通う\nアイドルちゃん』を登場させてしまいましたが！","zh":"结果，却让与故事无关的“在同一所钢琴教室上课的\n小偶像”登场了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"73ea4c6d9e4df526edef69f86d8338229d5feff58e0634ed88216e13be10ee59","ja":"私も、こうだったら面白いかな～って気持ちだけで\n主人公ちゃんに旅をさせちゃったな♪","zh":"我也是只凭着“要是这样的话会不会很有趣呢～”的心情，\n就让主角小姑娘踏上旅途了呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"f1c76dc190fa24f41d5f1f29f7ba955996e4ea4048507c0f3a19e7f61dee7b59","ja":"けど、それは物語を盛り上げる部分だから\nできることで、私はちゃんと物語をまとめないと。","zh":"不过，正因为那是烘托故事氛围的部分\n才能这么做，我必须好好把故事收尾才行。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"5422f114931f0e198d2e09ce61265468fdb4a0a0d59c71337f23af12812a22b5","ja":"う～ん……キレイにまとめなくても\nいいんじゃないかな？","zh":"嗯～……就算不整理得那么规整，\n应该也没关系吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"c4da30ab7e4a31771c34aaae3fcebca6a42b8adaab32060e85f73920eff92627","ja":"……！？　そう、なんでしょうか……？","zh":"……！？是、这样吗……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"83a0a3719b0536777fb161efd5940a379bb219aa8da9db2610ca9b405b04a53a","ja":"はい、こういうのはなんだってアリですよ、きっと！\n「自由に小説を書いてみよう」って企画ですし！","zh":"对，这种东西肯定怎样都可以的！\n毕竟是个“自由地写小说试试吧”的企划！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"b6b944c58e9cde81cc40b58185a9a5766030927e2373b15ddf3317b7952cf2d0","ja":"だからありさは、千早ちゃんが自由に書いた物語を\n読めるのを楽しみに待ってます！","zh":"所以亚利沙会满怀期待地等着，\n去读千早随心写下的故事！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"7292644a4c7aed92193c2dddda8489b5579f40f4603ae529f85d63bb81b1b1d7","ja":"うん、私も♪　きっとファンのみんなにとっても、\nそれが大正解だと思うよ♪","zh":"嗯，我也觉得♪ 对粉丝大家来说，\n那肯定也是最完美的答案哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"320cc6faa2617f7229fb1ecf136538ee748e10c89a891669f2b3915fa6da3e9e","ja":"……ふふっ。ありがとうございます。\n私、考えが固かったみたいですね。","zh":"……呵呵。谢谢您。\n我之前的想法似乎有些太死板了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"9cffac888d7c0e024d100419cabc84cb8bfb3d96f9ef6527b0ff70629e5c9025","ja":"（麗花さんから小説を渡されたとき、とっても\nワクワクした……まさか主人公が旅に出るなんて）","zh":"（丽花小姐把小说交给我的时候，我真的很\n兴奋……真没想到主角竟然踏上了旅途）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"bb99f2f43b8ce4d3fdecf4869c5d32cf072da3237b08b25c141ef148edef7f14","ja":"（私が書きたい、その続きは……音大よりも、\n人にピアノの音色を届ける旅を続けること……？）","zh":"（我想写下的后续是……比起音乐大学，\n继续将钢琴声传递给他人的旅程……？）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1031.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"5086646ccc53399df6aa285edbae01d5dd219aa536d92f68c6d55fa421f17271","ja":"（それでいつしか全世界に音楽を……\nなんて、ふふっ。自由にラストを考えてみよう）","zh":"（然后不知不觉间将音乐传遍全世界……\n开玩笑的，呵呵。自由地想象一下结局吧）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
